/Subject (The research described in this dissertation would not have been possible without the environment for research provided by the CAD research group at Berkeley under Professors Newton, Pederson, Sangiovanni-Vincentelli and Brayton. The availability of equipment, the environment of interaction among a variety of people working on many related projects with the consequent exchange of ideas and the flexibility to follow an idea wherever it may lead have all contributed to the current state of SPICE3.)
/Title (Analysis of Performance and Convergence Issues for Circuit Simulation)
/Filename (/pdf/TR/ADA637166.pdf)
